            <Text>Angle</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_ZOOM_TILT_ROTATE_PANEL_KEYS_TIP">
            <Text>See the keys for turning, tipping, going back to normal and this panel, and change them.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_ZOOM_TILT_ROTATE_PANEL_HEADING">
            <Text>Heading</Text>
        </Row>
